        <div class="space-y-4 text-stone-700 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            Understanding your exact net proceeds before going on the market prevents financial surprises at the closing table. Here is the complete breakdown of customary seller closing costs in Highlands County:
          </p>
          <div class="overflow-x-auto my-6">
            <table class="w-full text-xs sm:text-sm bg-white rounded-xl border border-stone-200 overflow-hidden text-left">
              <thead class="bg-[#1b3a5c] text-white">
                <tr>
                  <th class="p-3.5 sm:p-4 font-serif font-bold">Expense Item</th>
                  <th class="p-3.5 sm:p-4 font-serif font-bold">Standard Highlands County Rate</th>
                  <th class="p-3.5 sm:p-4 font-serif font-bold">Example on $275,000 Sale</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody class="divide-y divide-stone-200">
                <tr>
                  <td class="p-3.5 sm:p-4 font-bold text-stone-800">Florida Documentary Stamp Tax on Deed</td>
                  <td class="p-3.5 sm:p-4 text-stone-700">$0.70 per $100 of purchase price (state mandated)</td>
                  <td class="p-3.5 sm:p-4 font-mono text-stone-800">$1,925.00</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="p-3.5 sm:p-4 font-bold text-stone-800">Owner’s Title Insurance Policy</td>
                  <td class="p-3.5 sm:p-4 text-stone-700">Customarily paid by seller in Highlands County (promulgated rate)</td>
                  <td class="p-3.5 sm:p-4 font-mono text-stone-800">~$1,500.00</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="p-3.5 sm:p-4 font-bold text-stone-800">Title Search & Settlement / Closing Fee</td>
                  <td class="p-3.5 sm:p-4 text-stone-700">Title company search, examination, and closing coordination</td>
                  <td class="p-3.5 sm:p-4 font-mono text-stone-800">~$450.00 – $600.00</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="p-3.5 sm:p-4 font-bold text-stone-800">Real Estate Brokerage Fee</td>
                  <td class="p-3.5 sm:p-4 text-stone-700">Negotiated representation fee (covers marketing, staging, photography, multi-MLS)</td>
                  <td class="p-3.5 sm:p-4 font-mono text-stone-800">Per Agreement</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="p-3.5 sm:p-4 font-bold text-stone-800">Property Tax Proration</td>
                  <td class="p-3.5 sm:p-4 text-stone-700">Prorated to the exact day of closing for current calendar year</td>
                  <td class="p-3.5 sm:p-4 font-mono text-stone-800">Varies by closing date</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="p-3.5 sm:p-4 font-bold text-stone-800">HOA/CDD Estoppel Fee (if applicable)</td>
                  <td class="p-3.5 sm:p-4 text-stone-700">Association management preparation fee (standard Florida cap: $299)</td>
                  <td class="p-3.5 sm:p-4 font-mono text-stone-800">~$299.00</td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 italic">
            * Estimates provided for illustrative guidance. Actual title insurance rates are set by the Florida Office of Insurance Regulation. A personalized Net Sheet is provided to every client prior to listing.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Contextual CTA 10 -->
        <div class="my-6 p-4 sm:p-5 bg-emerald-50 rounded-xl border border-emerald-300 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-4">
